# Product scope — INTERNAL L&P only

Full text: [docs/PRODUCT_SCOPE_GUARDRAIL.md](../../docs/PRODUCT_SCOPE_GUARDRAIL.md).

## Users

Authorized **L&P Global Security staff** only. This is an internal operating platform for pursue → price → propose → submit externally → contract → recompete.

## Data entities (not users)

- **Buyer / agency / procurement customer** = intelligence record only (ISD, county, city, state, federal, commercial buyer).
- **Competitor** = intelligence record only.
- Neither becomes a platform user, tenant, or portal account because L&P bids to or contracts with them.

## Forbidden unless a future task explicitly instructs

Customer/client/buyer/agency portal or login; external customer accounts; customer approval/collaboration/messaging/self-service; buyer-facing dashboards or proposal/contract review; Stripe; subscription/seat/usage billing; commercial SaaS onboarding; contractor marketplace; commercialization features.

## Outputs leave the app

Generate PDF/DOCX/Google Doc/workbook/copy-paste for L&P to submit **outside** this product via the buyer’s channel. Do not build in-app buyer submission portals.

## Architecture

Keep org/memberships/RLS for L&P authorization isolation. Do **not** expand into commercial multi-tenant SaaS or buyer tenants without an explicit future task. Do not rebuild core architecture merely to remove extensibility.

## Docs

Prefer [PRODUCT_SCOPE_GUARDRAIL.md](../../docs/PRODUCT_SCOPE_GUARDRAIL.md) over ambiguous “optional commercialization” wording elsewhere. Leave `docs/OG DOCS/**` historical files unchanged.
